# v01.0: Harden the signup form

- [ ] Outcome: the form rejects an email with no at sign
- [ ] Outcome: a rejected email shows an error message beside the field, built on the validation above
- [ ] Outcome: submitting shows a pending state and disables the button, built on the error handling above

Each outcome edits `src/form/signup-form.ts`, `src/form/signup-state.ts`, and `src/form/signup-form.test.ts`, and builds on the one before it.
